  "ingredients": [
    "3 zucchini, sliced",
    "1 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup very soft butter",
    "2 cups evaporated milk",
    "2 eggs",
    "1.5 cups white sugar",
    "0.25 cup all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "1 tablespoon white sugar",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cinnamon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sO4CBH6Cg8Vh8d4iHqZnWRPJmLk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-215673-zucchini-creme-bars-VAT-step-01-cb1c989069664838b5d6957e7c88f76a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215673/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a pot of water to a boil over medium heat, and cook the zucchini until tender, about 5 minutes. Drain the zucchini in a colander set in the sink, and set aside to cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wN70wBb6jv2fcKFhP9qgx--yeIw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-215673-zucchini-creme-bars-VAT-step-02-1-9c126eb284b94cddb23ff5fc537ffee3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215673/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KGUgDH8bdHH0BENhxDmjlN50Vm0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-215673-zucchini-creme-bars-VAT-step-03-2cf3c59ce94940c096b15c362774e151.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215673/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine 1 cup of flour, 1/2 cup of sugar, and 1/2 cup of very soft butter in a bowl until crumbly and well combined. Press the mixture into the bottom of the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8_re-64EwsWhU3vccUb_zkyH-yc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-215673-zucchini-creme-bars-VAT-step-04-14bd70d49701414ea40047b5c7fc86ad.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215673/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Measure out 3 cups of cooked zucchini, and place into a blender. Pour in the evaporated milk and eggs, and add 1 1/2 cups of sugar, 1/4 cup of flour, 1 tablespoon of butter, and the vanilla extract to the zucchini. Pulse the blender several times to combine the ingredients, and then blend until the filling mixture is pureed, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bpp_9Ei409IUbzdDfOU7GmZtWpw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-215673-zucchini-creme-bars-VAT-step-05-9fd6be5f709a459aadd4a3b53b2f50b1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215673/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the mixture over the crust. Combine 1 tablespoon of sugar with the cinnamon in a small bowl, and sprinkle over the filling.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_NiYFdrQcG3TrvkN6H3TWZTOKIM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-215673-zucchini-creme-bars-VAT-step-06-1-4b3bb7705b794a49bf637a6063c732fb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215673/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until the middle of the dessert is set, about 45 minutes. Let cool, and chill in refrigerator before slicing.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HnDQXcgRgeE1ppAFgWu96Jbfv3o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-215673-zucchini-creme-bars-VAT-step-07-33639e459e384f599bcb94abcc9f83ed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215673/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
